Description: A comprehensive Shiny application designed to manage the entire lifecycle of a breeding program's genetic resources. It provides tools for data entry, inventory management, trial creation, and powerful querying, all backed by a robust SQLite database with a full audit trail. Built with the {golem} framework for robustness and easy deployment.
